{"_meta":{"com.empline/tool-documentation":{"access":"Requires OAuth store:listings:drafts:write consent. Requires separate store:listings:drafts:write consent and current EDIT_LISTINGS permission on an approved owned store. Optional photo order additionally requires store:listings:drafts:images:write; existing catalog/copy grants never acquire photo-write authority. Existing read and price grants do not authorize drafts. One draft per plan; nine-minute expiry; execute accepts only the plan and stable idempotency key.","alternatives":[],"authentication":{"scopes":["store:listings:drafts:write"],"type":"oauth"},"effect":"write","effects":"Preparation adds an expiring plan. Execution replaces the existing draft's catalog association and persisted card-data snapshot, with model edits limited to seller notes; an optional frozen photo permutation or explicit photo rotation also replaces draft display state. Photo changes require additional photo-write consent. Rotation retains its stable base and original archives and creates a complete verified artifact set with a durable receipt. Existing price is preserved, the listing remains DRAFT, and there are no marketplace writes.","examples":[{"idempotency_key":"draft-update-00000001","plan_id":"draft-plan-id"}],"failures":"Missing or foreign drafts, unowned preserved originals, incomplete photo pairs, stale versions, changed catalogs and revoked authority fail. After a lost response, inspect the same operation or find it by its original key; unknown outcomes must not be retried as new intent.","notFor":"No arbitrary photo URLs, chat-attachment ingestion, new catalog rows, grading or authenticity verification, price, inventory or publication changes.","purpose":"Save the exact prepared catalog link, draft seller notes and optional photo permutation or rotation to the same DRAFT once per durable intent. Reuse the original key after a lost response; replays only inspect receipts and never repeat uploads or native saves. Rotation 