ite authority. Existing read and price grants do not authorize drafts. One draft per plan; nine-minute expiry; execute accepts only the plan and stable idempotency key. Preparation adds an expiring plan. Execution replaces the existing draft's catalog association and persisted card-data snapshot, with model edits limited to seller notes; an optional frozen photo permutation or explicit photo rotation also replaces draft display state. Photo changes require additional photo-write consent. Rotation retains its stable base and original archives and creates a complete verified artifact set with a durable receipt. Existing price is preserved, the listing remains DRAFT, and there are no marketplace writes. Missing or foreign drafts, unowned preserved originals, incomplete photo pairs, stale versions, changed catalogs and revoked authority fail. After a lost response, inspect the same operation or find it by its original key; unknown outcomes must not be retried as new intent.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"examples":[{"idempotency_key":"draft-update-00000001","plan_id":"draft-plan-id"}],"properties":{"idempotency_key":{"description":"Stable client-generated key for this exact intent. Reuse it after a lost response; a different intent must use a new key.","maxLength":128,"minLength":16,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","type":"string"},"plan_id":{"description":"Persisted exact plan ID returned by the prepare tool; targets and amounts cannot be replaced during execution.","maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["plan_id","idempotency_key"],"type":"object"},"name":"supercatch_execute_listing_draft","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"context":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"account_ref":{"type":"string"},"app_id":{"const":"supercatch","type":"string"},"connection_ref":{"type":"string"},"